  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 6 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] C\xE2u n\xE0o l\xE0 'l\u1EDDi h\u1EE9a'
      an to\xE0n nh\u1EA5t?"
    options:
    - "Mai m\xECnh d\u1EADy s\u1EDBm (c\xF3 b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng)"
    - "T\u1ED1i nay m\xECnh l\xE0m xong (kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ECBnh ngh\u0129a 'xong')"
    - "M\xECnh ch\u1EC9 xem 1 video (YouTube \u0111\u1ED3ng \xFD)"
    - "M\xECnh ng\u1EE7 s\u1EDBm (2h s\xE1ng l\xE0 s\u1EDBm so v\u1EDBi 5h s\xE1ng)"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] N\u1EBFu tr\xED nh\u1EDB l\xE0 RAM,
      sinh vi\xEAn th\u01B0\u1EDDng c\xF3 bao nhi\xEAu GB?"
    options:
    - "16GB nh\u01B0ng cache \u0111\u1EA7y meme"
    - "32GB nh\u01B0ng swap sang \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i"
    - "8GB nh\u01B0ng Chrome"
    - "Kh\xF4ng \u0111o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u2014 random access"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] Khi b\u1EA1n n\xF3i 'hi\u1EC3u r\u1ED3i'
      nh\u01B0ng m\u1EAFt tr\u1ED1ng r\u1ED7ng, ngh\u0129a l\xE0?"
    options:
    - "B\u1EA1n hi\u1EC3u\u2026 ph\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u c\xE2u"
    - "B\u1EA1n hi\u1EC3u vibe"
    - "B\u1EA1n hi\u1EC3u l\xE0 ph\u1EA3i h\u1ECFi l\u1EA1i"
    - "B\u1EA1n hi\u1EC3u life"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] Ch\u1ECDn 'boss' kh\xF3 nh\u1EA5t
      trong \u0111\u1EDDi sinh vi\xEAn:"
    options:
    - "M\xF4n c\xF3 3 \u0111\u1ED3 \xE1n + 2 quiz + 1 vibe check"
    - "T\xECm ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i \u1EDF th\u01B0 vi\u1EC7n"
    - "Hi\u1EC3u \u0111\u1EC1 b\xE0i"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 boss \u0111\u1EC1u scale theo tu\u1EA7n"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 6] T\u1EA1i sao highlighter h\u1ED3ng
      l\u1EA1i nguy hi\u1EC3m?"
    options:
    - "V\xEC n\xF3 qu\xE1 \u0111\u1EB9p n\xEAn b\u1EA1n highlight c\u1EA3\u2026 c\u1EA3m
      x\xFAc"
    - "V\xEC gi\xE1o vi\xEAn kh\xF4ng th\xEDch m\xE0u h\u1ED3ng"
    - "V\xEC h\u1ED3ng l\xE0 warning color"
    - "V\xEC n\xF3 l\xE0m b\u1EA1n t\u01B0\u1EDFng m\xECnh \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
